>>
Rule 1 (If the first tensor's dimension is greater than 0, then the second parameter should be less than the first tensor's dimension.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then v_2 < ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 2 (If the reduction mode is "mean" or "sum", the input tensor should have at least one dimension.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : str} |= if v_2 = "mean" ∨ v_2 = "sum" then ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 3 (The minimum value of a tensor should be less than or equal to its maximum value.)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
>>
Rule 4 (If the first tensor is 1-dimensional, its shape must match the second tensor's 0th dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 1 then shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
>>
Rule 5 (If the string is "tanh", the tensor dtype should be float)
{v_1 : str, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 = "tanh" then (dtype_(v_2) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 8)
>>
Rule 6 (The dtype of a tensor should be integer)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5)
>>
Rule 7 (If the tensor is 2-dimensional, then the first dimension must be greater than the second dimension.)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 then shape(v_1, 0) > shape(v_1, 1)
>>
Rule 8 (If the shape of a tensor is greater than one at any dimension, then the minimum value must be smaller than the maximum value.)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : if shape(v_1, i) > 1 then min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
>>
Rule 9 (If the first tensor's dtype is int, the second tensor's dtype should be int or bool.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if (dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5) then (dtype_(v_2) = 0 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 5)
>>
Rule 10 (For the "bn,anm,bm->ba" string, the first tensor's ndim should be 3.)
{v_1 : str, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 = "bn,anm,bm->ba" then ndim(v_2) = 3
>>
Rule 11 (If the first tensor's dimension is one, it should have more than one element.)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 1 then shape(v_1, 0) > 1
>>
