{v_1: tensor} |= if shape(v_1, 0) > 100 then max(v_1) > 100 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 189 (If dimension more than 1 and first two shape[0] and shape[1] both larger than 10 then their datatypes should be either int or float)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 10 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 10 then (dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8)
