Rule 572 (if tensor v_1 has positive dimension and a minimum value greater than integer zero then the result of multiplication between maximum value of v_1 and float value v_2 must be less than 100 )
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : float} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ min(v_1) > 0 then max(v_1) * v_2 < 100
