Rule 583 (if integer v_1 is less than 0 and it is a valid index of tensor v_2 and bool v_3 is false, then shape value for the given dimension v_1 for tensor v_2 has to be equal to 1)
{v_1 : int, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : bool} |= if v_1 < 0 ∧ v_1 ≥ (0 - ndim(v_2)) ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0 ∧ v_3 = false then shape(v_2, v_1) = 1
>>
Rule 584 (If float v_1 is greater than 10, then the min of v_2 has to smaller than 0 and the product between it and its max value also has to smaller than v_1)
