Rule 588 (If int v_1 is between -10 and 10, and string v_2 is not 'none' and tensor v_3 has shape[0] equal to 10 then the result of multiplication between integer v_1 and float 0.5 must be smaller or equal to max of tensor v_3)
{v_1 : int, v_2 : str, v_3 : tensor} |= if v_1 > -10 ∧ v_1 < 10 ∧ v_2 ≠ "none" ∧ shape(v_3, 0) = 10 then v_1 * 0.5 ≤ max(v_3)
