Rule 602 (if string v_1 is contained in the list ['sum', 'mean', 'max', 'constant', 'tanh'], then minimum value of tensor v_2 should be greather then or equal integer v_3 which its value equal to zero)
{v_1 : str, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= if (v_1 = "mean" ∨ v_1 = "sum" ∨ v_1 = "max" ∨ v_1 = "constant" ∨ v_1 = "tanh") then min(v_2) ≥ v_3
