Rule 619 (if float v_1 is smaller than the min value and larger than -1 for tensor v_2, then result of multiplication of min value of v_2 with -1 has to smaller than 100)
{v_1 : float, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 < min(v_2) ∧ min(v_2) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0 then 0 - min(v_2) < 100
