Rule 653 (If string v_2 is "max", then the dimension 0 of input v_1 should be greater or equal to dimension 1)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : str} |= if v_2 = "max" then shape(v_1, 0) ≥ shape(v_1, 1)
>>
Rule 654 (The shape of input tensor should be between 1 and 10)
