>>
Rule 655 (The dtype of the tensor should be a union of int and float)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8
