>>
Rule 717 (if v_2 equal "sum", then the absolute value of minimum of v_1 should be less than absolute value of maximum.)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: str} |= if v_2 = "sum" then (if min(v_1) < 0 then -1*min(v_1) else min(v_1)) < (if max(v_1) < 0 then -1*max(v_1) else max(v_1))
