Rule 718 (If the string equals to "tanh", and ndim of input v_1 is 2, shape in dim 0 should be equal to shape in dim 1)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: str} |= if v_2 = "tanh" ∧ ndim(v_1) = 2 then shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_1, 1)
>>
Rule 719 (If tensor v_1 ndim is equal to 3, the sum of its shapes on all dimensions should be smaller than the given number)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2: int} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 then shape(v_1, 0) + shape(v_1, 1) + shape(v_1, 2) < v_2
>>
Rule 720 (if v_2 is true, minimum of tensor v_1 must be smaller than 0)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: bool} |= if v_2 = true then min(v_1) < 0
>>
Rule 721 (For a 2D tensor if all shape dimensions are non-negative, then max(v_1) should be smaller or equal to 10000.)
{v_1: tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ (shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 0) ∧ (shape(v_1, 1) ≥ 0) then max(v_1) ≤ 10000
>>
Rule 722 (if number of dimensions of the input is equal to 2, the shape must follow this equation shape(0) * shape(1) > 100)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 then shape(v_1, 0) * shape(v_1, 1) > 100
>>
Rule 723 (if a tensor is at least two dimensional, then its data type must be int or float)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 then (1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5) ∨ (6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8)
>>
