{v_1: tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 1 then min(v_1) * max(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 725 (If string v_2 == "constant", and dtype is int, then max value has to be between 0 and 100)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : str} |= if v_2 = "constant" ∧ (1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5) then max(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ max(v_1) ≤ 100
