>>
Rule 731 (If the dtype of input tensor v_1 is string then number of dimensions should be 1)
{v_1: tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 11 then ndim(v_1) = 1
>>
Rule 732 (If the number of dimensions is greater than zero, then the product of shapes must be divisible by 2)
{v_1: tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i)) / 2 = ((∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i)) + 1 - 1) / 2
>>
Rule 733 (If a bool tensor v_1 is given, there should be no repeated values.)
{v_1: tensor} |= if (dtype_(v_1) = 0) then ∃i ∈ [0, shape(v_1, 0) - 1] : ∃j ∈ [0, shape(v_1, 1) - 1] : v_1 ≠ v_1
