Rule 951 (If the first parameter is a tensor with a single element, then the second parameter must be true)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : bool} |= if (ndim(v_1) = 0) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = 1 ∧ ∀i ∈ [1, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 1) then v_2 = true
