>>
Rule 1027 (The shape of the weight tensor should be consistent with the input channel and output channel of conv2d)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int, v_4 : int} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 4 ∧ shape(v_2, 1) = v_3 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = v_4
