>>
Rule 1476 (If `v_1` is string value and it's from  ["ii", "ii->i", "i,j->ij", "bij,bjk->bik", "...ij->...ji", "bn,anm,bm->ba"], then for any shape dimensions of a tensor `v_2`, the result must not be 0)
{v_1 : str, v_2 : tensor} |= if (v_1 = "ii" ∨ v_1 = "ii->i" ∨ v_1 = "i,j->ij" ∨ v_1 = "bij,bjk->bik" ∨ v_1 = "...ij->...ji" ∨ v_1 = "bn,anm,bm->ba") then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) ≠ 0
